Value Filldown,Required slot (\d+)
Value Required fan (\d+)
Value fan_status (\S+)
Value fan_airflow_direction (\S+)
Value preferred_fan_airflow_direction (\S+)

Start
  ^\s*(?:Slot|Fan)\s+\d+\s*: -> Continue.Record
  ^\s*Slot\s+${slot}\s*:\s*$$
  ^\s*Fan\s+${fan}\s*:\s*$$
  ^\s*State\s*:\s*${fan_status}\s*$$
  ^\s*Airflow Direction:\s*${fan_airflow_direction}\s*$$
  ^\s*Prefer Airflow Direction:\s*${preferred_fan_airflow_direction}\s*$$
